sequenceDiagram
  participant W as WeCom Adapter
  participant C as Channel Inbox
  participant I as Service Intake
  participant R as Deterministic Rules
  participant J as Journey Store
  participant M as Manual Review
  participant T as TicketActionService
  participant O as Communication Outbox
  W->>C: persist normalized message
  C-->>W: committed
  C->>I: create or append intake
  I->>J: create/append Journey and Leg
  J->>R: evaluate persisted facts + versions
  R->>J: persist result + provenance + hash
  alt ticket eligible
    J->>T: safe command suggestion through port
  else description needed
    J->>O: one-question notification suggestion
  else manual review
    J->>M: enqueue auditable review item
  end
  Note over R,O: model_provider_calls = 0
